      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17075,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Volvimos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "Hey, Myotismon's probably already\ngotten to work by now.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17087,
      "_bytes": 55,
      "translation": "Oye, seguro que Myotismon se\nha puesto manos a la obra."
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Yeah, at Karigaoka! The eighth\nchild must be there!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17143,
      "_bytes": 53,
      "translation": "¡Sí, en Hikarioka! ¡El octavo\nniño debe estar allí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "We have to find them before he\ndoes and help them!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17197,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "¡Debemos encontrarlo antes que\nél y ayudarlo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "We have to find them before he\ndoes and help them!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 17248,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "¡Debemos encontrarlo antes que\nél y ayudarlo!"
    },
    {
